    "headline": "Wind Advisory issued October 16 at 11:03AM PDT until October 17 at 2:00PM PDT by NWS Los Angeles/Oxnard CA",
    "description": "* WHAT...Northeast winds 20 to 30 mph with gusts of 35 to 55 mph\nexpected.\n\n* WHERE...Calabasas and Agoura Hills, Central Ventura County Valleys,\nEastern San Fernando Valley, Eastern Santa Monica Mountains\nRecreational Area, Northern Ventura County Mountains, Santa Clarita\nValley, Southeastern Ventura County Valleys, Southern Ventura\nCounty Mountains, and Western San Fernando Valley.\n\n* WHEN...Until 2 PM PDT Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree\nlimbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Strongest winds are expected today with weaker\nwinds tonight and Saturday.",
